---
import HomeTemplate from '../components/templates/HomeTemplate.astro';
---

<HomeTemplate
  title="Free RPG Maker MZ Save Editor Online | .rmmzsave"
  description="Edit tested RPG Maker MZ .rmmzsave save files in your browser. No download or server upload."
  keywords="rpg maker mz save editor, rmmzsave editor, .rmmzsave editor online"
>
  <div slot="seo-content" class="max-w-4xl mx-auto prose prose-blue prose-lg text-gray-600 mb-16">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 text-center">
      Browser-Based RPG Maker Save Editor
    </h2>
    <p>
      Welcome to <strong>SaveFileTool</strong>, a free
      <a href="/editor/rpg-maker-mz/">RPG Maker MZ save editor</a>
      for compatible <code>.rmmzsave</code> files, with backup-first guidance before you
      replace any file.
    </p>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 my-8 not-prose">
      <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-100">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Why Use a Web-Based Editor?</h3>
        <ul class="text-sm space-y-2 list-disc list-inside">
          <li>No suspicious .exe downloads</li>
          <li>Works on Mac, Windows, Linux, Android</li>
          <li>Always up-to-date instantly</li>
          <li>Process files locally for privacy</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-100">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Published Support</h3>
        <ul class="text-sm space-y-2 list-disc list-inside">
          <li><strong>Tested public entry</strong>: .rmmzsave</li>
          <li><strong>Verified edit path</strong>: gold / money on a real save workflow</li>
          <li><strong>Candidate fields</strong>: actor, inventory, variables, and switches require in-game verification</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p>
      Unlike editors that require unknown downloads, <strong>SaveFileTool</strong>
      keeps the main editing flow in your web browser. The current public build does not ship
      third-party analytics or advertising scripts, and selected save files are handled locally.
    </p>
  </div>
</HomeTemplate>
